TRANSLATION:
{{TAG:0003:0003:}}İyi ki doğdun, {{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}{{TAG:0005:0008:}}!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
Bugün ne güzel bir gün,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} değil mi?{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0025:}}Bazıları
yaşlanma fikrini sevmez,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
ama ben bunu bilgelik ve deneyim kazanmak
gibi görüyorum!
{{TAG:0003:0010:}}Az kalsın unutuyordum!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}{{TAG:0003:0000:}} Gönderdiğim doğum
günü kartını okudun mu?{{TAG:0007:0001:}} {{TAG:0003:001A:}}Senin
için yazımı düzgün tutmaya çok uğraştım.{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}}{{TAG:0003:0025:}}

FR:
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Joyeux anniversaire, {{TAG:0005:0008:}} !{{TAG:0007:0001:}}
{{TAG:0003:000B:}}Il y a quelque chose de changé en
toi...
... un je-ne-sais-quoi de maturité, un
air plus adulte, plus accompli...{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0005:}}qui te va à merveille, d'ailleurs !

EN:
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Happy birthday,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} {{TAG:0005:0008:}}!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
I hope this is truly a wonderful year
for you!{{TAG:0007:0001:}} {{TAG:0003:0005:}}You deserve it!

IT:
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Joyeux anniversaire,{{TAG:0007:0000:0F000000}} {{TAG:0005:0008:}}!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
Spero tanto che avrai un anno
meraviglioso!{{TAG:0007:0001:}} {{TAG:0003:0005:}}Te lo meriti!

TRANSLATION:
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}İyi ki doğdun,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} {{TAG:0005:0008:}}!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
Umarım önündeki yıl gerçekten harika
geçer!{{TAG:0007:0001:}} {{TAG:0003:0005:}}Bunu hak ediyorsun!

EN:
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}I planned on giving this to you if
I saw you.{{TAG:0007:0000:0F000000}} I got you a present!{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0003:}}So I'm surprised and happy to see
you today!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} I hope you like it!{{TAG:0007:0000:1E000000}}{{TAG:0003:0000:}}

FR:
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Je voulais t'offrir un cadeau, {{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}juste
comme ça, {{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}et comme par hasard,{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}
aujourd'hui c'est ton anniversaire !
{{TAG:0003:0005:}}Quelle coïncidence amusante !{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}
Tiens, j'espère que ça te plaira !

IT:
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Ho sentito che è il tuo compleanno
e ho un piccolo cadeau per te!{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0025:}}Spero che ti piaccia!

DE:
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Ich hab mir viele Gedanken über
dein Geburtstagsgeschenk gemacht.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
Ich hoffe, es gefällt dir!
